{"id":"33b00fd0b4d5a311","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-compactness-equivalent.md","title":"Compactness Equivalent","display":"Compactness Equivalent","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-compactness-equivalent","aliases":["93-lem-compactness-equivalent"],"display":"Compactness Equivalent","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-compactness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-compactness-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-compactness-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Compactness Equivalent"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" href=\"?note=f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" title=\"93-df-compactness\">93-df-compactness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-compactness-equivalent---Compactness-Equivalent\">lem-compactness-equivalent - Compactness Equivalent</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula-set candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span> is a consequence relation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\)</span> is the compactness predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" href=\"?note=f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" title=\"93-df-compactness\">93-df-compactness</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the set of finite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the finite-premise formulation used by compactness arguments.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-compactness-equivalent---Compactness-Equivalent","text":"lem-compactness-equivalent - Compactness Equivalent","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)$ is the compactness predicate of [[93-df-compactness]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":965,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ca0c3180b26a019","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["f3b6daa28ddd9b5d"]}